00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:27.380
Posez-le !

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:36.320
Xue Huan.

00:09:36.320 --> 00:09:37.270
Arrêtez ! Arrêtez !

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.080
Lu Lingfeng,

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:41.790
